okbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* Zest of 1 [[Cookbook:Orange|orange]]\n* 2 cups water\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Brandy|brandy]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n* 1 stick [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Slice the sweet potatoes and lay in a deep [[Cookbook:Baking Pan|baking pan]] with the cinnamon stick.\n# Mix the liquids, zest, cloves, brown sugar and nutmeg together in a pot; bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] and cook for 5 minutes.\n# Pour liquid mixture over the dish's contents.\n# Cover with [[Cookbook:Aluminium Foil|foil]] and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] at 350°F for 30 minutes or until sweet potatoes appear to be tender and glazed.\n# Chill for 3 hours, and serve cold.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using sweet potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nutmeg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick]]\n[[Category:Southern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brandy]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Refrigerated recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Strong Candied Sweet Potatoes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 large sweet potatoes","sourceText":"5 large sweet potatoes","amountText":"5 large sweet potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2¼ cups brown sugar","sourceText":"2¼ cups brown sugar","amountText":"2¼ cups brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"5 cloves","sourceText":"5 cloves","amountText":"5 cloves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Zest of 1 orange","sourceText":"Zest of 1 orange","amountText":"Zest of 1 orange","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 cups water","sourceText":"2 cups water","amountText":"2 cups water","amount":